From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Sanchez <nathanasanchez@google.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 14:25:27 -0500
Subject: [Graphite] Only allow clip path key bounds within int16_t

We determine if the unclipped bounds will fit within int16_t (the
assumption made prior with asserts), otherwise we key by the save record
ID. In addition to doing this, we also ensure that we don't OR in the
sign extension of the int16_t value within the key.

Bug: 578656869
Change-Id: I9b5208523d410ad6f84b62d7b37df263c7db7d79
Reviewed-on: https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/1414056
Reviewed-by: Michael Ludwig <michaelludwig@google.com>
Commit-Queue: Nathan Sanchez <nathanasanchez@google.com>

